('Southern Prize and State Fellowships for Visual Arts','South Arts','fellowship','Nine $5,000 state fellowships, one per South Arts state; two fellows are then chosen for the Southern Prize ($25,000 winner, $10,000 finalist) plus a Hambidge Center residency.',5000,25000,NULL,'https://www.southarts.org/grants-opportunities/southern-prize-and-state-fellowships-visual-arts','Individual visual artists 18+ who have lived in AL, FL, GA, KY, LA, MS, NC, SC or TN for at least 2 years. Students can''t apply. $25 fee (waivers available). Next deadline not yet announced; it is usually in February or March. Check the site in early 2027.',ARRAY['painting','photography','sculpture','mixed_media','digital','printmaking','ceramics','drawing','textile','installation']::text[],'regional','South Arts region: AL, FL, GA, KY, LA, MS, NC, SC, TN','any',25,true,DATE '2026-09-24','https://www.southarts.org/grants-opportunities/southern-prize-and-state-fellowships-visual-arts'),
